/// issuer identifier MUST NOT have either, so such a value is not an issuer and
/// there is no correct location to derive from it — appending the remainder as
/// though it were a path produced `…?x=1/.well-known/openid-configuration`, with
/// the discovery suffix inside a query. Failing closed means a caller finds no
/// metadata and refuses the connector rather than dialling a malformed address.
